abstract: >-
  VisualRefinery is a domain-agnostic Agent Skill and production workflow for
  transforming raw source material into polished, evidence-grounded visual
  artifacts through research, editorial synthesis, information architecture,
  visual design, full-page inspection, and technical validation.
